            "body": "I follow the instruction and updated the call to super().sample(*args, **kwargs). \r\nYou opened the floodgates. Now, when dataset.sample(tokenizer) is called:\r\n*args captures both self and the positional tokenizer safely into a tuple.\r\n\r\nkwargs captures any optional keyword configs.\r\n\r\nsuper().sample(*args, kwargs) unpacks them flawlessly and hands them off to the parent class (CustomDataset), which knows exactly what to do with the tokenizer!",
